# Implementation Plan: Self-Service Change Password Feature

Introduce a secure, self-service **Change Password** feature for all profile dashboards (**Admin**, **Operations Manager**, **Accounting Officer**, **Sales**, **Marketing**, and **Staff**) accessible via the Settings modal in the user profile dropdown.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Security Protocol**:
> 1. To ensure account security, users must enter their **Current Password** before setting a new password.
> 2. The **New Password** must be at least 6 characters long and must differ from the current password.
> 3. An enterprise audit log entry (`USER_PASSWORD_CHANGED`) will be recorded whenever a user updates their password.
> 4. After a successful password change, the user's active session will remain valid so their workflow is not abruptly interrupted.

